# DAX Measures

## Total Sales

```DAX
Total Sales =
SUM('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Sales])
```

## Total Profit

```DAX
Total Profit =
SUM('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Order Profit Per Order])
```

## Total Orders

```DAX
Total Orders =
DISTINCTCOUNT('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Order Id])
```

## Profit Margin %

```DAX
Profit Margin % =
DIVIDE([Total Profit], [Total Sales], 0)
```

## Actual Shipping Time(days)

```DAX
Actual Shipping Time(days) =
AVERAGE('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Days for shipping (real)])
```

## Scheduled Shipping Time

```DAX
Scheduled Shipping Time =
AVERAGE('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Days for shipment (scheduled)])
```

## Shipping Delay

```DAX
Shipping Delay =
[Actual Shipping Time(days)] - [Scheduled Shipping Time]
```

## Late Risk Orders

```DAX
Late Risk Orders =
CALCULATE(
    DISTINCTCOUNT('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Order Id]),
    'DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[Late_delivery_risk] = 1
)
```

## Late Delivery %

```DAX
Late Delivery % =
DIVIDE([Late Risk Orders], [Total Orders], 0)
```

## Order Date Only

```DAX
Order Date Only =
DATEVALUE('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[order date (DateOrders)])
```

## DateTable

```DAX
DateTable =
CALENDAR(
    MIN('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[order date (DateOrders)]),
    MAX('DataCoSupplyChainDataset (2)'[order date (DateOrders)])
)
```
